Acknowledgements
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This mod was inspired by "Custom Experience Orbs" by Walksy
(https://modrinth.com/mod/custom-experience-orbs), released under the MIT
License.

No source code from that project was copied or adapted. Experience Orb
Tweaks is an independent implementation written against Minecraft 1.21.11,
and extends the concept with value-based rendering and compatibility with
orb-merging mods.

"Clumps" by BlameJared (https://modrinth.com/mod/clumps, MIT License) is
referenced only as a runtime test dependency in the build script. It is not
bundled, and it is not required to use this mod.
